# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv
.claude

# Build spec (kept locally, not published)
B1-tactical-metrics-build-spec.md

# Working notes — for our use only, not committed
PROGRESS.md
design_decision.md

# Downloaded provider data + precomputed cache (regenerate with scripts/).
